lish the full obligation.","uri":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:clause:ao-necessary-not-full"},{"arguments":[{"ref":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:standing:consequence","role":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:vocabulary:role:standing"},{"ref":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:concept:observation","role":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:vocabulary:role:subject"},{"literal":"while the oracle's fidelity is unestablished","role":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:vocabulary:role:condition"},{"literal":"discharged-argument","role":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:vocabulary:role:support-kind"},{"ref":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:clause:p6","role":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:vocabulary:role:support"}],"clause_type":"constraint","operator":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:vocabulary:operator:states","source_refs":["stdo-3://build_tenants/claude/standards/FOUNDATIONS.md#assertions-and-observation"],"statement":"An observed test pass remains an observation while the oracle's fidelity is unestablished; it does not become established satisfaction of the source obligation, and a reported failure is treated the same way.","uri":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:clause:ao-pass-is-observation"},{"arguments":[{"ref":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:standing:consequence","role":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:vocabulary:role:standing"},{"ref":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:concept:retention","role":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:vocabulary:role:subject"},{"literal":"discharged-argument","role":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:vocabulary:role:support-kind"},{"ref":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:clause:p3","role":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:vocabulary:role:support"},{"ref":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:clause:p6","role":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:vocabulary:role:support"}],"clause_type":"constraint","operator":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:vocabulary:operator:states","source_refs":["stdo-3://build_tenants/claude/standards/FOUNDATIONS.md#change-impact-and-evidence-reuse"],"statement":"A changed hash alone establishes neither invalidity nor equivalence.","uri":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:clause:ci-hash-alone"},{"arguments":[{"ref":"urn:stdo-3:claude:i3:standing:consequence","role":"urn: